msgid "Fatigue"
msgstr "Umor"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_army.gd:716
msgid "Fatigue comes from hunger alone: out of food an army marches slower, after %s it starts losing men, and after %s it is lost."
msgstr "Umor dolazi samo od gladi: bez hrane vojska maršira sporije, posle %s počinje da gubi ljude, a posle %s je izgubljena."

