msgstr "Skuplje za svakih %d regrutovanih (do sada %d)."

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_army.gd:1182
msgid "Counted over all your villages, from the moment one is queued. Each one that dies or is called off brings the price back down (the dearest is paid back); founding a village with them does not."
msgstr "Broji se u svim tvojim selima, od trenutka kad se jedan stavi u red. Svaki koji pogine ili se otkaže vraća cenu nazad (vraća se najskuplji); osnivanje sela sa njima ne vraća."

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_army.gd:1196
msgid "%s · %s each"
msgstr "%s · po %s"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_army.gd:1197
msgid "  (queue full)"
msgstr "  (red pun)"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_army.gd:1202
msgid "Stance when attacked"
msgstr "Stav pri napadu"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_army.gd:1203
msgid "How the garrison fights, and the stance new armies take. Risk against reward: the earlier a stance breaks, the harder it hits or holds."
msgstr "Kako se garnizon bori i koji stav uzimaju nove vojske. Rizik protiv nagrade: što se stav ranije slomi, to jače udara ili drži."

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_army.gd:1227
msgid "%s: attack ×%.2f, defense ×%.2f, %s."
msgstr "%s: napad ×%.2f, odbrana ×%.2f, %s."

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_army.gd:1243
msgid "Each army fights in its own stance and breaks on its own losses: one that breaks falls back home beaten (its hero wounded, its general killed) while the others fight on."
msgstr "Svaka vojska se bori u svom stavu i slama se po svojim gubicima: ona koja se slomi povlači se kući poražena (njen junak ranjen, njen general ubijen) dok se ostale bore dalje."

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_army.gd:1270
msgid "Our men are outside the walls, fighting in the open."
msgstr "Naši su van zidina, bore se na otvorenom."

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_army.gd:1274
msgid "Sure? Charge out"
msgstr "Sigurno? Juriš napolje"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_army.gd:1274
msgid "Charge out of the walls"
msgstr "Juriš van zidina"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_army.gd:1283
msgid "The garrison and the armies with it leave the walls and fight in the open from the next round: no wall defense, no shooting from the walls, and the horde's fighters are no longer held back. A horde still building its engines is fought at once. No going back in this battle."
msgstr "Posada i vojske uz nju napuštaju zidine i od sledeće runde se bore na otvorenom: nema odbrane zidina ni gađanja sa njih, a borci horde više nisu zadržani. Horda koja još gradi sprave napada se odmah. U ovoj bici nema povratka unutra."

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_army.gd:1317
msgid "Training %d × %s"
msgstr "Obuka %d × %s"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_army.gd:1337
msgid "In battle: attack · defense · health"
msgstr "U bici: napad · odbrana · zdravlje"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_army.gd:1338
msgid "The hero fights in the ranks as a champion, striking like a band of soldiers. It commands the troops it stands with; struck down, it is carried home wounded and a general with it takes command."
msgstr "Junak se bori u redovima kao šampion i udara kao čitava četa. Zapoveda trupama uz koje stoji; kad padne, odnose ga ranjenog kući, a general koji je s njim preuzima zapovedništvo."

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_army.gd:1339
msgid "A general fights in the ranks too, a lesser champion than the hero. It commands the troops it stands with when no hero does, and takes command when the hero falls; struck down, it dies."
msgstr "I general se bori u redovima, kao slabiji šampion od junaka. Zapoveda trupama uz koje stoji kad junaka nema, i preuzima zapovedništvo kad junak padne; kad padne, gine."

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_army.gd:1351
msgid "No rally point"
msgstr "Nema zbornog mesta"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_army.gd:1353
msgid "Rally point: troops trained in your other settlements march here once done."
msgstr "Zborna tačka: trupe obučene u tvojim drugim naseljima dolaze ovamo čim budu spremne."

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_army.gd:1355
msgid "Rally point: %s. Troops trained here march there once done."
msgstr "Zborna tačka: %s. Trupe obučene ovde idu tamo čim budu spremne."

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_army.gd:1360
msgid "Stop rallying"
msgstr "Ukini zbornu tačku"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_army.gd:1362
msgid "Rally here"
msgstr "Zborna tačka ovde"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_army.gd:1363
msgid "One of your settlements can be your rally point: every batch of troops trained in your other settlements marches there as soon as it is done, to join its garrison. Settlers stay home, and so do troops of a village under siege."
msgstr "Jedno tvoje naselje može biti zborna tačka: svaka grupa trupa obučena u tvojim drugim naseljima kreće tamo čim bude spremna i pridružuje se tamošnjem garnizonu. Doseljenici ostaju kod kuće, kao i trupe sela pod opsadom."

