msgid "Clear a bandit camp."
msgstr "Očisti razbojnički logor."

#: data/achievements.json
msgid "Into the Den"
msgstr "U jazbinu"

#: data/achievements.json
msgid "Clear a lair of Nav."
msgstr "Očisti jazbinu Navi."

#: data/achievements.json
msgid "Unchained"
msgstr "Bez okova"

#: data/achievements.json
msgid "Free captives from the camp that holds them."
msgstr "Oslobodi zarobljenike iz logora koji ih drži."

#: data/achievements.json
msgid "Grave Goods"
msgstr "Grobni darovi"

#: data/achievements.json
msgid "Search an ancient site."
msgstr "Pretraži drevno mesto."

#: data/achievements.json
msgid "Keeper of the Flame"
msgstr "Čuvar plamena"

#: data/achievements.json
msgid "Find Svarog's Ember in an ancient site."
msgstr "Pronađi Svarogov žar na drevnom mestu."

#: data/achievements.json
msgid "Lorekeeper"
msgstr "Čuvar predanja"

#: data/achievements.json
msgid "Find a lore scroll."
msgstr "Pronađi svitak predanja."

#: data/achievements.json
msgid "Errand Rider"
msgstr "Glasonoša"

#: data/achievements.json
msgid "Bring your hero home from a quest."
msgstr "Vrati junaka kući sa zadatka."

#: data/achievements.json
msgid "Warleader"
msgstr "Vojskovođa"

#: data/achievements.json
msgid "Finish a quest your hero leads the army on."
msgstr "Završi pohod na koji junak vodi vojsku."

#: data/achievements.json
msgid "Two Hearths"
msgstr "Dva ognjišta"

#: data/achievements.json
msgid "Found a second village."
msgstr "Osnuj drugo selo."

#: data/achievements.json
msgid "Palisade"
msgstr "Palisada"

#: data/achievements.json
msgid "Raise a fort in the field."
msgstr "Podigni utvrdu u polju."

#: data/achievements.json
msgid "Stone upon Stone"
msgstr "Kamen na kamen"

#: data/achievements.json
msgid "Raise a stage of the Kalinov Bridge."
msgstr "Podigni jedan deo Kalinovog mosta."

#: data/achievements.json
msgid "Carried Home"
msgstr "Iznesen kući"

#: data/achievements.json
msgid "Your hero was struck down in battle, and lived."
msgstr "Tvoj junak je oboren u bici, i preživeo je."

#: data/achievements.json
msgid "Many Banners"
msgstr "Mnogo barjaka"

#: data/achievements.json
msgid "Stand against two hordes in one battle."
msgstr "Odupri se dvema hordama u jednoj bici."

#: data/achievements.json
msgid "To the Heart of Nav"
msgstr "U srce Navi"

#: data/achievements.json
msgid "Sack a stronghold beyond the border."
msgstr "Opljačkaj tvrđavu s one strane granice."

#: data/achievements.json
msgid "Ashes"
msgstr "Pepeo"

#: data/achievements.json
msgid "Lose a village to a horde."
msgstr "Izgubi selo od horde."

#: data/achievements.json
msgid "The River Road"
msgstr "Rečni put"

#: data/achievements.json
msgid "See a boat built at a shipyard."
msgstr "Dočekaj da se u brodogradilištu sagradi čamac."

#: data/achievements.json
msgid "Dawn over Prav"
msgstr "Zora nad Pravi"

#: data/achievements.json
msgid "Hold the Holy City through Ritual Night."
msgstr "Odbrani Sveti grad tokom Obredne noći."

#: data/battle.json
msgid "Defensive"
msgstr "Odbrambeni"

#: data/battle.json
msgid "Balanced"
msgstr "Uravnotežen"

#: data/battle.json
msgid "Offensive"
msgstr "Napadački"

#: data/battle.json
msgid "Hold the Line"
msgstr "Drži liniju"

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "Beyond the Holy City the Kalinov Bridge crosses the Smorodina, the river of fire, from Nav to Yav, the living world, and every horde that comes walks over it. The volkhvs mean to raise it on from Yav to Prav, the realm of the gods: once the Ritual Arch joins it to Prav, the gods' light runs down the whole bridge and nothing from Nav can set foot on it again. The hordes know this, and will throw everything at the city on the night the arch is bound."
msgstr "Iza Svetog grada Kalinov most prelazi Smorodinu, ognjenu reku, iz Navi u Jav, svet živih, i svaka horda koja dolazi ide preko njega. Volhvi nameravaju da ga produže iz Javi do Pravi, carstva bogova: kad ga Obredni luk spoji sa Pravi, svetlost bogova poteći će celim mostom i ništa iz Navi više neće moći da kroči na njega. Horde to znaju i u noći kad se luk veže baciće sve na grad."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "Foundation Stones"
msgstr "Kamen temeljac"

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "Blessing of the Old Builders"
msgstr "Blagoslov starih graditelja"

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "The first builders sleep in the Builders' Barrow with their mark, the rune that bound the old span to Yav. Their dead still guard it: break through and bring the rune back, or no stone will hold the new span."
msgstr "Prvi graditelji počivaju u Graditeljskoj humci sa svojim znakom, runom koja je vezala stari luk za Jav. Njihovi mrtvi je i dalje čuvaju: probij se i vrati runu, ili nijedan kamen neće držati novi luk."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "A road to Prav can't rise from common stone. The old builders were buried with the rune that made their stones remember the rite; only stones marked with it will carry the bridge on from Yav."
msgstr "Put do Prava ne može se podići od običnog kamena. Stari graditelji sahranjeni su s runom koja je činila da se njihovo kamenje seća obreda; samo kamenje obeleženo njome poneće most dalje od Java."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "The Oak Piers"
msgstr "Hrastovi stubovi"

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "Blessing of the Bridge Wrights"
msgstr "Blagoslov mostograditelja"

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "The sacred oaks stand over a den of Nav's beasts, grown fat on the grove's offerings. Clear the Den under the Sacred Oaks, or no volkhv will lift an axe in the grove."
msgstr "Sveti hrastovi stoje nad jazbinom Navovih zveri, ugojenih od žrtava iz gaja. Očisti Jazbinu pod svetim hrastovima, ili nijedan volhv neće podići sekiru u gaju."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "The piers that lift the bridge towards Prav are cut from the sacred oaks, but Veles' beasts have made their den among the roots and nobody can fell a tree while they howl."
msgstr "Stubovi koji dižu most ka Pravu seku se od svetih hrastova, ali su Velesove zveri napravile jazbinu među korenjem i niko ne može oboriti drvo dok one zavijaju."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "The Iron Span"
msgstr "Gvozdeni raspon"

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "Blessing of Svarog's Forge"
msgstr "Blagoslov Svarogove kovačnice"

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "Nav knows the forge is lit. The Smith-Breakers, a host sworn to put out Svarog's flame, march on the Holy City apart from the hordes: beat them before the walls, and the iron can be forged."
msgstr "Nav zna da je kovačnica upaljena. Kovačolomci, vojska zakleta da ugasi Svarogov plamen, kreću na Sveti grad odvojeno od hordi: porazi ih pred zidinama i gvožđe može da se kuje."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "Iron forged under Svarog's eye carries the road up into the sky. The forge in the Holy City must burn without break, and Nav will send its own to put it out."
msgstr "Gvožđe kovano pod Svarogovim okom nosi put u nebo. Kovačnica u Svetom gradu mora goreti bez prestanka, a Nav će poslati svoje da je ugase."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "The Guardian Rails"
msgstr "Ograda čuvara"

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "Blessing of Perun's Thunder"
msgstr "Blagoslov Perunovog groma"

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "The Eye of Veles, the stone that sees every road from Nav, is kept in the North's deepest stronghold. Raid the North to its full depth, sack the stronghold and bring the Eye back: set in the rails, it shows the guardians everything that comes."
msgstr "Velesovo oko, kamen koji vidi svaki put iz Nava, čuva se u najdubljoj tvrđavi Severa. Prodri u Sever do kraja, opljačkaj tvrđavu i vrati Oko: postavljeno u ograde, pokazuje čuvarima sve što dolazi."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "The rails are carved with the faces of guardians so that nothing from Nav can climb the new span to Prav; but guardians must see to guard, and only the Eye of Veles sees the roads of Nav."
msgstr "Ograde su izrezbarene licima čuvara da ništa iz Nava ne bi moglo da se popne na novi luk do Prava; ali čuvari moraju da vide da bi čuvali, a samo Velesovo oko vidi puteve Nava."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "The Ritual Arch"
msgstr "Obredni luk"

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "Forge the ritual torc from a Svarog's Ember: the volkhvs bind the arch with it, and without it the new span is only a road into Prav for the enemy."
msgstr "Iskuj obrednu grivnu od Svarogovog žara: volhvi njome vezuju luk, a bez nje novi raspon je samo put u Prav za neprijatelja."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "The arch at the top of the span opens onto Prav. It is bound with a torc of Svarog's fire, and once it stands, everything in Nav will come at once: Ritual Night."
msgstr "Luk na vrhu raspona otvara se ka Pravi. Vezuje se grivnom od Svarogove vatre, i čim bude stajao, sve što je u Navi doći će odjednom: Obredna noć."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "The Builders' Rune"
msgstr "Graditeljska runa"

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "Explore the Builders' Barrow, deep in guardians, while this stage is open."
msgstr "Istraži Graditeljsku humku, punu čuvara, dok je ova faza otvorena."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "The Den under the Sacred Oaks"
msgstr "Jazbina pod svetim hrastovima"

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "Clear the quest lair while this stage is open."
msgstr "Očisti jazbinu zadatka dok je ova faza otvorena."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "Beat the Smith-Breakers"
msgstr "Porazi Kovačolomce"

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "Beat the quest army marching on the Holy City."
msgstr "Porazi vojsku zadatka koja kreće na Sveti grad."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "The Eye of Veles"
msgstr "Velesovo oko"

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "Raid the North to its full depth and sack its stronghold while this stage is open."
msgstr "Prodri u Sever do kraja i opljačkaj njegovu tvrđavu dok je ova faza otvorena."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "Craft the ritual torc"
msgstr "Iskuj obrednu grivnu"

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "Forge the ritual torc from a Svarog's Ember."
msgstr "Iskuj obrednu grivnu od Svarogovog žara."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "Bring back a relic"
msgstr "Donesi relikviju"

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "Explore an ancient site while this stage is open."
msgstr "Istraži drevno mesto dok je ova faza otvorena."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "Clear a monster lair"
msgstr "Očisti jazbinu čudovišta"

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "An army clears a lair of the North while this stage is open."
msgstr "Vojska očisti jazbinu Severa dok je ova faza otvorena."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "Weather a wave unscathed"
msgstr "Preživi talas bez gubitka"

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "A wave ends without the Holy City losing Sanctity since this stage began."
msgstr "Talas se završi a da Sveti grad ne izgubi svetost od početka ove faze."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "Hold a strong point"
msgstr "Zadrži uporište"

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "Win a field battle at a choke point or from a fort while this stage is open."
msgstr "Dobij bitku u polju na tesnacu ili iz utvrde dok je ova faza otvorena."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "With the arch raised, the volkhvs begin the rite that will join the bridge to Prav. Every horde in Nav feels it. Tonight they all come at once, from every front, to break the city before the last words are spoken."
msgstr "Kad je luk podignut, volhvi počinju obred koji će spojiti most sa Pravi. Svaka horda u Navi to oseća. Večeras sve dolaze odjednom, sa svih strana, da slome grad pre nego što se izgovore poslednje reči."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "The Kalinov Bridge holds"
msgstr "Kalinov most stoji"

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "The last horde broke against the walls and the rite was finished. The Kalinov Bridge runs from Nav through Yav to Prav, the gods' light holds it end to end, the road from Nav is shut, and the bells of the Holy City ring for the first time in a generation. The old faith lives on, because you held."
msgstr "Poslednja horda se razbila o zidine i obred je završen. Kalinov most vodi iz Navi kroz Jav do Pravi, svetlost bogova drži ga s kraja na kraj, put iz Navi je zatvoren, a zvona Svetog grada zvone prvi put posle jednog pokolenja. Stara vera živi, jer ste vi izdržali."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "The Holy City has fallen"
msgstr "Sveti grad je pao"

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "The walls are breached and the sanctuary fires are out. The hordes pour over the Kalinov Bridge unopposed. Some of the people escaped into the forests, carrying the songs with them; perhaps one day they will try again."
msgstr "Zidine su probijene, a vatre u svetilištu ugašene. Horde se bez otpora sjuruju preko Kalinovog mosta. Deo naroda pobegao je u šume, noseći pesme sa sobom; možda će jednog dana pokušati ponovo."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "The Builders' Barrow"
msgstr "Graditeljska humka"

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "The Smith-Breakers"
msgstr "Kovačolomci"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Elder's Hall"
msgstr "Starešinska kuća"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "The heart of the village. Each level opens another building slot and builds a little faster; every few levels add a place in the build queue and another outpost."
msgstr "Srce sela. Svaki nivo otvara još jedno mesto za gradnju i gradi malo brže; svakih nekoliko nivoa dodaje mesto u redu gradnje i još jednu ispostavu."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Woodcutter"
msgstr "Drvoseča"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Cuts wood in the forest around the village."
msgstr "Seče drvo u šumi oko sela."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Quarry"
msgstr "Kamenolom"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Breaks stone from the hills around the village."
msgstr "Lomi kamen u brdima oko sela."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Farm"
msgstr "Njiva"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Grows grain, which feeds the village and its troops."
msgstr "Gaji žito, koje hrani selo i njegove trupe."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Iron Mine"
msgstr "Rudnik gvožđa"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Digs iron for weapons, armour and walls."
msgstr "Kopa gvožđe za oružje, oklope i zidine."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Storehouse"
msgstr "Skladište"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "How much of each resource the village can keep; what comes in above it is lost. A village may build more than one."
msgstr "Koliko svakog resursa selo može da čuva; ono što stigne preko toga propada. Selo može da izgradi više od jednog."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Barracks"
msgstr "Kasarna"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Trains infantry. Each level trains them faster, and higher levels open stronger troops."
msgstr "Obučava pešadiju. Svaki nivo je obučava brže, a viši nivoi otvaraju jače trupe."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Stables"
msgstr "Konjušnica"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Breeds horses and trains riders. Each level trains them faster, and higher levels open stronger riders."
msgstr "Odgaja konje i obučava jahače. Svaki nivo ih obučava brže, a viši nivoi otvaraju jače jahače."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Shooting Range"
msgstr "Strelište"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Trains archers, skirmishers and throwers. Each level trains them faster, and higher levels open stronger shooters."
msgstr "Obučava strelce, kopljobacače i bacače. Svaki nivo ih obučava brže, a viši nivoi otvaraju jače strelce."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Hero's Hall"
msgstr "Dvorana junaka"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Recruits generals, who lead armies and command garrisons. Each level lets the hero recover from wounds faster here, and every few levels allow another general."
msgstr "Unajmljuje generale, koji predvode vojske i zapovedaju posadama. Svaki nivo ovde brže leči junaka od rana, a svakih nekoliko nivoa dozvoljava još jednog generala."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Scout Lodge"
msgstr "Izviđačnica"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Trains scouts, who ride out to see a horde before it arrives."
msgstr "Obučava izviđače, koji jašu da vide hordu pre nego što stigne."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Caravan Yard"
msgstr "Karavansko dvorište"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Keeps caravans to carry resources to allies and to the Holy City vault; each level adds more."
msgstr "Drži karavane koji nose resurse saveznicima i u riznicu Svetog grada; svaki nivo dodaje još."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Settlers' Lodge"
msgstr "Dom doseljenika"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Trains settlers, who walk out to found new villages."
msgstr "Obučava naseljenike, koji idu da osnuju nova sela."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Studies the techs of the research tree and brings in the research every tech costs; what you learn helps all your villages."
msgstr "Proučava tehnologije sa stabla istraživanja i donosi istraživanje koje svaka tehnologija košta; ono što naučiš pomaže svim tvojim selima."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "A camp on a nearby hex that gathers what the land gives: wood in forests, stone and iron in hills and mountains, grain on plains and lakes."
msgstr "Logor na obližnjem polju koji skuplja ono što zemlja daje: drvo u šumama, kamen i gvožđe u brdima i planinama, žito na ravnicama i jezerima."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Granary-Temple"
msgstr "Žitnica-hram"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "The stag-folk's own: a temple granary that brings in grain and feeds the troops for less."
msgstr "Samo jelenov rod: hramska žitnica koja donosi žito i jeftinije hrani trupe."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Stone Redoubt"
msgstr "Kameno utvrđenje"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "The bear-folk's own: a stone keep that makes the garrison harder to break."
msgstr "Samo medvedov rod: kamena kula zbog koje je posadu teže slomiti."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Longhouse Hall"
msgstr "Dugačka dvorana"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "The wolf-folk's own: a longhouse where warriors eat less and train faster."
msgstr "Samo vučji rod: duga kuća u kojoj ratnici jedu manje i brže se obučavaju."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Walls"
msgstr "Bedemi"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "The walls round the village: hordes must break or climb them before they reach the garrison. Higher levels change wood for stone."
msgstr "Zidine oko sela: horde moraju da ih probiju ili preskoče pre nego što dođu do posade. Viši nivoi menjaju drvo kamenom."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Archer Tower"
msgstr "Strelačka kula"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "A tower on the walls: its archers make the garrison strike harder while the walls stand."
msgstr "Kula na zidinama: njeni strelci čine da posada jače udara dok zidine stoje."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Gate Tower"
msgstr "Kapija-kula"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Strengthens the gate, so the walls take longer to batter down."
msgstr "Ojačava kapiju, pa se zidine duže probijaju."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Ballista Platform"
msgstr "Postolje za balistu"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "A great crossbow on the walls that smashes the horde's siege engines."
msgstr "Veliki samostrel na zidinama koji razbija opsadne sprave horde."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Murder Holes"
msgstr "Puškarnice"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Openings over the gate to rain stones on the attackers: the garrison defends better while the walls stand."
msgstr "Otvori iznad kapije za bacanje kamenja na napadače: posada se bolje brani dok zidine stoje."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Moat"
msgstr "Opkop"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "A moat before the walls: it keeps off battering and climbers and slows the building of siege engines; at higher levels it holds water."
msgstr "Jarak pred zidinama: odbija udarce i penjače i usporava gradnju opsadnih sprava; na višim nivoima drži vodu."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Watchtower"
msgstr "Osmatračnica"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Sees hordes coming from farther away, so the warning comes sooner."
msgstr "Vidi horde izdaleka, pa upozorenje stiže ranije."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Forester"
msgstr "Šumar"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Tends the woods so they grow back thick: 5% more wood per level, from fields and outposts alike. Needs a Woodcutter of level 5."
msgstr "Neguje šume da ponovo izrastu guste: 5% više drveta po nivou, i sa polja i sa ispostava. Potrebna je Drvoseča nivoa 5."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Stonemason"
msgstr "Kamenorezac"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Dresses the stone as it comes in: 5% more stone per level. Needs a Quarry of level 5."
msgstr "Obrađuje kamen čim stigne: 5% više kamena po nivou. Potreban je Kamenolom nivoa 5."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Mill"
msgstr "Vodenica"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Grinds the grain so less goes to waste: 5% more grain per level. Needs a Farm of level 5."
msgstr "Melje žito da manje propadne: 5% više žita po nivou. Potrebna je Njiva nivoa 5."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Smelter"
msgstr "Topionica"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Smelts the ore hotter: 5% more iron per level. Needs an Iron Mine of level 5."
msgstr "Topi rudu na jačoj vatri: 5% više gvožđa po nivou. Potreban je Rudnik gvožđa nivoa 5."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Hospital"
msgstr "Bolnica"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Tends the wounded: when the garrison holds its own village, 5% per level of its fallen get up again."
msgstr "Leči ranjene: kad posada odbrani svoje selo, 5% njenih palih po nivou ponovo ustaje."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Masons' Guild"
msgstr "Zidarski esnaf"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Master builders who teach the village's hands the craft: every building goes up 2% faster per level."
msgstr "Majstori graditelji koji uče seoske ruke zanatu: svaka zgrada se gradi 2% brže po nivou."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Workers' Huts"
msgstr "Radničke kolibe"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Homes for the hands who work the fields, woods, quarries and mines: 2% more of every resource per level."
msgstr "Domovi za ruke koje rade na poljima, u šumama, kamenolomima i rudnicima: 2% više svakog resursa po nivou."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Grain Silo"
msgstr "Silos za žito"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "A tall store for grain alone: the village keeps more grain, for its people, its garrison and the armies it feeds. A village may build more than one."
msgstr "Visoko skladište samo za žito: selo čuva više žita, za svoje ljude, posadu i vojske koje hrani. Selo može izgraditi više od jednog."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Fisherman's Hut"
msgstr "Ribarska koliba"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Nets and weirs on the water beside the village bring in fish: grain every hour, more each level. Only for a village beside a lake or on a river."
msgstr "Mreže i vrše na vodi pored sela donose ribu: žito svakog sata, više sa svakim nivoom. Samo za selo pored jezera ili na reci."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Water Wheel"
msgstr "Vodenica"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "The river turns the wheel and the wheel turns the work: 3% more of every resource and 3% faster building per level. Only for a village beside a lake or on a river."
msgstr "Reka okreće točak, a točak okreće posao: 3% više svakog resursa i 3% brža gradnja po nivou. Samo za selo pored jezera ili na reci."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Windmill"
msgstr "Vetrenjača"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Sails on the hilltop grind the grain finer: 6% more grain per level. Only for a village on hills."
msgstr "Krila na vrhu brda melju žito sitnije: 6% više žita po nivou. Samo za selo na brdima."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Ranch"
msgstr "Ranč"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Herds graze the open plains: grain every hour, more each level, and the village's riders come from better horses, 2% stronger per level (10% at the top). Only for a village on the plains."
msgstr "Krda pasu na otvorenoj ravnici: žito svakog sata, više sa svakim nivoom, a konjanici sela jašu bolje konje, 2% jači po nivou (10% na vrhu). Samo za selo na ravnici."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Mountain Lodge"
msgstr "Planinska koliba"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Miners, quarrymen and woodcutters who know the mountain's slopes: 5% more wood, stone and iron per level. Only for a village next to a mountain."
msgstr "Rudari, kamenoresci i drvoseče koji poznaju planinske padine: 5% više drveta, kamena i gvožđa po nivou. Samo za selo pored planine."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Market"
msgstr "Pijaca"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Trades one resource for another, at better rates every level, and buys the hero's spare gear."
msgstr "Menja jedan resurs za drugi, po boljem kursu sa svakim nivoom, i otkupljuje junakovu suvišnu opremu."

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Rod Jelena"
msgstr "Rod Jelena"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Stag"
msgstr "Jelen"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "The stag-folk of the river meadows: first to sow, first to harvest, their villages grow like spring grass. They were never riders."
msgstr "Jelenov rod sa rečnih livada: prvi seju, prvi žanju, a sela im rastu kao prolećna trava. Konjanici nikad nisu bili."

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Its arms are those of Nizhny Novgorod (1781): a red stag walking, on silver."
msgstr "Grb mu je grb Nižnjeg Novgoroda (1781): crveni jelen u hodu, na srebrnom polju."

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Grain and fast village growth"
msgstr "Žito i brz rast sela"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Weak cavalry"
msgstr "Slaba konjica"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Rod Rysa"
msgstr "Rod Risa"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Lynx"
msgstr "Ris"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "The lynx-folk of the deep woods strike from the shadows of the trees and are gone before the horde can turn. Their elders trust old ways over new learning."
msgstr "Risov rod iz dubokih šuma udara iz senke drveća i nestaje pre nego što se horda okrene. Njihove starešine više veruju starim običajima nego novom znanju."

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Its arms are those of Gomel (granted in 1781): a gold lynx lying, on blue."
msgstr "Grb mu je grb Gomelja (dodeljen 1781): zlatni ris koji leži, na plavom polju."

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Wood and ambushes"
msgstr "Drvo i zasede"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Slower research"
msgstr "Sporije istraživanje"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Rod Medvěda"
msgstr "Rod Medveda"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Bear"
msgstr "Medved"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "The bear-folk of the iron hills dig deep and build thick walls. They are slow to leave the den they have made."
msgstr "Medvedov rod sa gvozdenih brda kopa duboko i zida debele zidove. Teško napuštaju brlog koji su sagradili."

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Its arms are those of Yaroslavl (1672): a black bear upright with a gold poleaxe, on silver."
msgstr "Grb mu je grb Jaroslavlja (1672): crni medved uspravljen sa zlatnom sekirom, na srebrnom polju."

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Iron and fortifications"
msgstr "Gvožđe i utvrđenja"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Slower expansion"
msgstr "Sporije širenje"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Rod Bobra"
msgstr "Rod Dabra"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Beaver"
msgstr "Dabar"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "The beaver-folk know every river and ford; their barges carry what the roads cannot. Their homes are built for trade, not for siege."
msgstr "Dabrov rod zna svaku reku i svaki gaz; njihove barke nose ono što putevi ne mogu. Domovi su im građeni za trgovinu, ne za opsadu."

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Its arms are those of Bobrov (1781): a beaver in its own colour, on silver."
msgstr "Grb mu je grb Bobrova (1781): dabar u svojoj boji, na srebrnom polju."

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Caravan speed and capacity"
msgstr "Brzina i kapacitet karavana"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Weaker fortifications"
msgstr "Slabija utvrđenja"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Rod Sokola"
msgstr "Rod Sokola"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Falcon"
msgstr "Sokol"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "The falcon-folk of the open steppe ride fast and see far; their scouts come home when others do not. They have little patience for stonework."
msgstr "Sokolov rod sa otvorene stepe jaše brzo i vidi daleko; njihovi izviđači se vraćaju kad drugi ne mogu. Nemaju strpljenja za kamen."

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Its arms are those of Sokołów Podlaski (seal of 1764): a falcon on an oak branch with a gold ring in its beak, on gold."
msgstr "Grb mu je grb Sokolova Podlaskog (pečat iz 1764): soko na hrastovoj grani sa zlatnim prstenom u kljunu, na zlatnom polju."

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Cavalry and scouts (fewer scout losses)"
msgstr "Konjica i izviđači (manji gubici izviđača)"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Costlier forts"
msgstr "Skuplje utvrde"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Rod Volka"
msgstr "Rod Vuka"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Wolf"
msgstr "Vuk"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "The wolf-folk of the northern stone fields know the cold and the things that come out of it. Their thin soil feeds them poorly."
msgstr "Vučji rod sa severnih kamenih polja poznaje hladnoću i ono što iz nje dolazi. Tanka zemlja ih slabo hrani."

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Its arms are those of Vovchansk (1781): a silver wolf running over green ground, on blue."
msgstr "Grb mu je grb Vovčanska (1781): srebrni vuk u trku preko zelene zemlje, na plavom polju."

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Stone and cold resistance (against the North)"
msgstr "Kamen i otpornost na hladnoću (protiv Severa)"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Weaker grain"
msgstr "Slabije žito"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Rod Tura"
msgstr "Rod Tura"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Aurochs"
msgstr "Tur"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "The aurochs-folk of the river meadows stand like their wild cattle: shoulder to shoulder, horns forward, never giving ground. Their heavy wagons crawl."
msgstr "Turov narod sa rečnih livada stoji kao njihova divlja goveda: rame uz rame, rogovima napred, nikad ne uzmičući. Njihova teška kola puze."

#: data/clans.json
msgid "A black aurochs' head, on gold."
msgstr "Crna glava tura, na zlatu."

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Home defense and infantry"
msgstr "Odbrana doma i pešadija"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Slower caravans"
msgstr "Sporiji karavani"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Rod Gavrana"
msgstr "Rod Gavrana"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Raven"
msgstr "Gavran"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "The raven-folk keep the old knowledge and send their birds where men cannot go. Their fields are thin; their elders read the sky instead."
msgstr "Gavranov narod čuva staro znanje i šalje svoje ptice kuda ljudi ne mogu. Njive su im mršave; njihovi starci umesto toga čitaju nebo."

#: data/clans.json
msgid "A black raven standing, on silver."
msgstr "Crni gavran koji stoji, na srebru."

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Research and scouts (fewer scout losses)"
msgstr "Istraživanje i izvidnici (manje izgubljenih izvidnika)"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Less grain"
msgstr "Manje žita"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Rod Lisice"
msgstr "Rod Lisice"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Fox"
msgstr "Lisica"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "The fox-folk trade where others fight and hide what others lose. Their palisades are an afterthought: they would rather not be found."
msgstr "Lisičji narod trguje gde se drugi bore i krije ono što drugi gube. Palisade su im usputna misao: radije bi da ih niko ne nađe."

#: data/clans.json
msgid "A red fox leaping, on green."
msgstr "Crvena lisica u skoku, na zelenom."

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Market trades, and less lost to plundering hordes"
msgstr "Trgovina na pijaci, i manje izgubljeno od horde koja pljačka"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Weaker home defense"
msgstr "Slabija odbrana doma"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Rod Zmije"
msgstr "Rod Zmije"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Serpent"
msgstr "Zmija"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "The serpent-folk live among the old stones and know where the ancients hid their treasures. Their many mouths are hard to feed."
msgstr "Zmijin narod živi među starim kamenjem i zna gde su drevni sakrili svoja blaga. Mnoga njihova usta teško je nahraniti."

#: data/clans.json
msgid "A gold serpent coiled, on blue."
msgstr "Zlatna sklupčana zmija, na plavom."

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Stone, iron and richer finds in ancient sites"
msgstr "Kamen, gvožđe i bogatiji nalazi na drevnim mestima"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Costlier upkeep"
msgstr "Skuplje izdržavanje"

#: data/difficulty.json
msgid "Story"
msgstr "Priča"

#: data/difficulty.json
msgid "Hard"
msgstr "Teško"

#: data/difficulty.json
msgid "Nightmare"
msgstr "Košmar"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Monsters of the North"
msgstr "Čudovišta Severa"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Beasts and creatures of the old forests. Erratic and savage; they fight on past reason."
msgstr "Zveri i stvorenja starih šuma. Nepredvidive i divlje; bore se i kad više nema smisla."

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Leshy's Thrall"
msgstr "Lešijev rob"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Rusalka"
msgstr "Rusalka"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Grey Wolf"
msgstr "Sivi vuk"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Cave Bear"
msgstr "Pećinski medved"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Upyr"
msgstr "Upir"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Volkolak"
msgstr "Vukodlak"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Likho"
msgstr "Liho"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Storm Vila"
msgstr "Vila oluje"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Black Boar"
msgstr "Crni vepar"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Div"
msgstr "Div"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Firebird"
msgstr "Žar-ptica"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Zmey Whelp"
msgstr "Zmajče"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Nomad Horde"
msgstr "Nomadska horda"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Fast horse archers out of the steppe. They raid rather than stay, burn outposts far from their road and carry off more."
msgstr "Brzi konjički strelci iz stepe. Radije pljačkaju nego da ostanu, pale ispostave daleko od svog puta i odnose više."

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Steppe Levy"
msgstr "Stepski ustanik"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Horse Archer"
msgstr "Konjički strelac"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Steppe Raider"
msgstr "Stepski pljačkaš"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Steppe Shaman"
msgstr "Stepski šaman"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Kipchak Bowman"
msgstr "Kipčački strelac"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Lancer"
msgstr "Kopljonoša"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Kurgan Guard"
msgstr "Kurganska straža"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Fire Archer"
msgstr "Ognjeni strelac"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Khan's Guard"
msgstr "Kanova straža"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Bagatur"
msgstr "Bagatur"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Khan's Marksman"
msgstr "Kanov strelac"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Steppe Cataphract"
msgstr "Stepski katafrakt"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Scaling Ladder"
msgstr "Opsadne lestve"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Order of the One Throne"
msgstr "Red Jedinog prestola"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Disciplined zealots in heavy ranks with crossbows. Slow, and they do not break easily."
msgstr "Disciplinovani zelote u teškim redovima, sa samostrelima. Spori, i ne lome se lako."

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Zealot"
msgstr "Zelot"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Crossbowman"
msgstr "Samostrelac"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Mounted Sergeant"
msgstr "Konjički narednik"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Inquisitor"
msgstr "Inkvizitor"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Arbalester"
msgstr "Arbalestar"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Knight-Brother"
msgstr "Vitez-brat"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Templar of the Throne"
msgstr "Templar prestola"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Pavise Crossbowman"
msgstr "Samostrelac sa pavezom"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Grand Knight"
msgstr "Veliki vitez"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Champion of the Throne"
msgstr "Šampion prestola"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Fire Priest"
msgstr "Ognjeni sveštenik"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Lord Marshal"
msgstr "Lord maršal"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Siege Ram"
msgstr "Opsadni ovan"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Catapult"
msgstr "Katapult"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Siege Tower"
msgstr "Opsadna kula"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "The Order's western host: knights and crossbows. Slow, and they do not break easily."
msgstr "Zapadna vojska Reda: vitezovi i samostreli. Spori, i ne lome se lako."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Battle Fury"
msgstr "Bojni bes"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "+4% attack for every troop per rank."
msgstr "+4% napada za svu vojsku po rangu."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Spearhead"
msgstr "Vrh koplja"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "+6% infantry attack per rank."
msgstr "+6% napada pešadije po rangu."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Horse Lord"
msgstr "Gospodar konja"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "+6% cavalry attack per rank."
msgstr "+6% napada konjice po rangu."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Shield Bearer"
msgstr "Štitonoša"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "+4% defense for every troop per rank."
msgstr "+4% odbrane za svu vojsku po rangu."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Hold Fast"
msgstr "Čvrst stav"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "+5% for defenders at home per rank."
msgstr "+5% za branioce kod kuće po rangu."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Iron Will"
msgstr "Gvozdena volja"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Raiders take 8% less per rank."
msgstr "Pljačkaši odnose 8% manje po rangu."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Pathfinder"
msgstr "Tragač"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Scouts from the hero's village travel 10% faster per rank."
msgstr "Izviđači iz junakovog sela putuju 10% brže po rangu."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Keen Eyes"
msgstr "Oštro oko"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Scouts from the hero's village are 5 points likelier to return per rank."
msgstr "Izviđači iz junakovog sela se vraćaju sa 5 poena većom verovatnoćom po rangu."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Quartermaster"
msgstr "Intendant"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Caravans from the hero's village carry 10% more per rank."
msgstr "Karavani iz junakovog sela nose 10% više po rangu."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Axe of Perun"
msgstr "Perunova sekira"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Thunder rides its edge."
msgstr "Grom jaše na njenom sečivu."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Thunder Banner"
msgstr "Gromovni barjak"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Woven with Perun's sign."
msgstr "Utkan Perunovim znakom."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Bear-hide Cloak"
msgstr "Ogrtač od medveđe kože"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "From a cave bear of the north."
msgstr "Od pećinskog medveda sa severa."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Bear-tooth Amulet"
msgstr "Amajlija od medveđeg zuba"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Old as the forest."
msgstr "Stara kao šuma."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Ash Spear"
msgstr "Jasenovo koplje"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Light and true."
msgstr "Lako i pravo."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Mail Shirt"
msgstr "Verižnjača"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Ring after ring."
msgstr "Karika za karikom."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Thread of Mokosh"
msgstr "Mokošina nit"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "The spinner hides what is yours."
msgstr "Prelja krije ono što je tvoje."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Wolf Banner"
msgstr "Vučji barjak"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "The pack defends its own."
msgstr "Čopor brani svoje."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Steppe Horse"
msgstr "Stepski konj"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Never tires."
msgstr "Nikad se ne umara."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Grey Stallion"
msgstr "Sivi pastuv"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "A warhorse of the old princes."
msgstr "Bojni konj starih knezova."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Perun's Thunder"
msgstr "Perunov grom"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Bear Clan"
msgstr "Medveđi klan"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Dobrynya"
msgstr "Dobrinja"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "The serpent-slayer prince"
msgstr "Knez zmajoubica"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "A prince's son who struck down the Zmey at the Puchai river. Bold in the charge, and a retinue to keep fed."
msgstr "Kneževski sin koji je ubio Zmaja na reci Pučaj. Hrabar u jurišu, uz pratnju koju treba hraniti."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Rallying cry"
msgstr "Bojni poklič"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "His name alone makes men fight harder at their own gates."
msgstr "Samo njegovo ime tera ljude da se jače bore pred svojim vratima."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Vasilisa"
msgstr "Vasilisa"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "The forest huntress"
msgstr "Šumska lovkinja"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "She reads the forest like a letter. Her bow never misses, but she is no shield-wall fighter."
msgstr "Šumu čita kao pismo. Njen luk ne promašuje, ali nije borac za zid od štitova."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Tracker"
msgstr "Tragač"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Moves fast and teaches the scouts to come back alive."
msgstr "Kreće se brzo i uči izviđače da se vrate živi."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Volkh"
msgstr "Volh"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "The wise volkhv"
msgstr "Mudri volhv"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "A priest of the old gods who knows herbs, stars and secrets. Wisdom over the sword."
msgstr "Sveštenik starih bogova koji zna trave, zvezde i tajne. Mudrost iznad mača."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Healing rites"
msgstr "Obredi isceljenja"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Rises from wounds in half the time, and learns from every fight."
msgstr "Od rana se diže dvostruko brže i uči iz svake bitke."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Sadko"
msgstr "Sadko"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "The merchant rider"
msgstr "Trgovac jahač"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "A gusli player turned the richest trader of Novgorod. Gold opens more gates than steel."
msgstr "Guslar koji je postao najbogatiji trgovac Novgoroda. Zlato otvara više kapija od čelika."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Silver tongue"
msgstr "Srebrni jezik"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Talks raiders out of a fifth of what they came for."
msgstr "Odgovori pljačkaše od petine onoga po šta su došli."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Nastasya"
msgstr "Nastasja"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "The shieldmaiden"
msgstr "Ratnica sa štitom"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "A polyanitsa of the steppe border who has never given ground. Slow to march, impossible to move."
msgstr "Poljanica sa stepske granice koja nikad nije ustuknula. Spora u maršu, nepomerljiva u boju."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Unbreakable"
msgstr "Nesalomiva"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Her spearmen train faster and hold the walls longer."
msgstr "Njeni kopljanici se brže obučavaju i duže drže zidine."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Ilya"
msgstr "Ilija"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "The old bogatyr"
msgstr "Stari bogatir"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Thirty years he sat by the stove; then he rose stronger than any man. Strong in all things, slow to learn new ones."
msgstr "Trideset godina je sedeo kraj peći, a onda ustao jači od svakog čoveka. Snažan u svemu, spor da nauči nešto novo."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Strength of the earth"
msgstr "Snaga zemlje"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Mother Earth hides him: he is wounded for less time."
msgstr "Majka Zemlja ga čuva: kraće ostaje ranjen."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Alyosha"
msgstr "Aljoša"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "The cunning youngest bogatyr"
msgstr "Lukavi najmlađi bogatir"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "A priest's son from Rostov who wins by wit as often as by the sword: he beat Tugarin by a trick no one else would stoop to."
msgstr "Popov sin iz Rostova koji pobeđuje dosetkom jednako često kao mačem: Tugarina je savladao lukavstvom na koje se niko drugi ne bi spustio."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Sharp wit"
msgstr "Oštar um"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "His scouts ride faster, and raiders carry off less of what he guards."
msgstr "Njegovi izvidnici jašu brže, a pljačkaši odnose manje od onoga što on čuva."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Mikula"
msgstr "Mikula"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "The giant ploughman"
msgstr "Div orač"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "The ploughman whose plough no prince's retinue could lift from the furrow. The earth loves him; war comes slowly to him."
msgstr "Orač čiji plug nijedna kneževa družina nije mogla da izvuče iz brazde. Zemlja ga voli; rat mu dolazi sporo."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Mother earth's son"
msgstr "Sin majke zemlje"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Full barns: every village stores a tenth more."
